# Only what the image build needs goes to Docker: no dependencies, build output, local data or the library.
.git
library
**/node_modules
**/bin
**/obj
**/.data
**/dist
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/*.db
**/*.db-*
backend/tests
backend/tools
backend/perf
backend/docs
.env
**/appsettings.*.local.json
